    },
    "briefing": "Maurice is wiping the glass of a small dark frame behind the Blue Silk bar when a girl comes in from the back door. The silhouette wants the deck at the corner of the bar when the small grey chrome comes out of the safe.",
    "title_ko": "모리스와 왕자들",
